{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53397","headline":"金灯 · 卢殷","name":"金灯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"疎茎秋拥翠，幽艳夕添红。\n有月长灯在，无烟烬火同。\n香浓初受露，势庳不知风。\n应笑金台上，先随晓漏终。\n（见令狐楚《御览诗》）（按：《全唐诗》卷五六三误收於卢溵下，今移正。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢殷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53397.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53397","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}